stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> RUNNING
    RUNNING --> RUNNING: after a cycle, 92 percent
    RUNNING --> DOWN: after a cycle, 8 percent fault
    DOWN --> RUNNING: timer expires, 3 to 10 s
    note right of RUNNING
        One pick and place cycle per tick.
        total_cycles += 1.
        good_cycles += 1 with 95 percent.
        Conveyor 0.15 m/s.
    end note
    note right of DOWN
        No cycles run. Conveyor 0 m/s.
        Gateway adds elapsed time to downtime.
    end note
